OL,3,AJohn Bishop cancels shows after
OL,4,Amotorbike accident with Tim Peake
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian John Bishop has cancelled
OL,7,Fupcoming events after breaking his
OL,8,Fankle while riding a motorbike with
OL,9,Fastronaut Tim Peake.
OL,11,FBishop, from Liverpool, shared on
OL,12,Fsocial media he had suffered the ankle
OL,13,Finjury on 30 August, and his foot was
OL,14,F"looking a bit fat" and "the bruising
OL,15,Fis out".
OL,17,FHis cancelled shows include a live
OL,18,Fcomedy gig at Somerset County Cricket
OL,19,FClub's ground in Taunton, Somerset, and
OL,20,Fhe will no longer be taking part in Sir
OL,21,FChris Hoy's Tour de 4 charity bike ride
OL,22,Fin Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
