OL,3,AJohn Bishop cancels shows after
OL,4,Amotorbike accident with Tim Peake
OL,5,
OL,6,FBishop said: "I went out for a
OL,7,Fmotorbike ride with Tim Peake, who's a
OL,8,Fbrilliant lad and a great cyclist. I
OL,9,Flearnt a lesson today. Astronauts are
OL,10,Fbetter motorcyclists than comedians."
